{"id":"n24445-1-7","stage":2,"title":"아끼다 · 节省","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24445-1-7-1","ko":"이번 달은 써야 할 돈이 많아.","zh":"这个月我要花的钱太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"달은","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달은","audio":"/audio/2f96d8959093a614484a.mp3"}},{"text":"써야","meaning":"花，费，花费","explanation":"쓰다：花，费，花费；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"5","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써야","audio":"/audio/3eeba0baa1ae7cce1a5b.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"많아.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아","audio":"/audio/cddc8e9fac3b225d8a31.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"花，费，花费","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事用时间或钱。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/11b58abb070ca7edb42f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24445-1-7-2","ko":"용돈을 좀 아껴 써야겠구나.","zh":"看来得节省一下零用钱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"용돈을","meaning":"零花钱，零用钱","explanation":"용돈：零花钱，零用钱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"용돈","audio":"/audio/07c35f2a6c1c1bdf46f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67869","senseId":"1","lemma":"용돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"용돈을","audio":"/audio/a30aee8c825b7cfcc683.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"아껴","meaning":"节省，可惜","explanation":"아끼다：节省，可惜；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"아끼다","audio":"/audio/f72efea0664035d04563.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24445","senseId":"1","lemma":"아끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아껴","audio":"/audio/eb90b06c15c15b284d7a.mp3"}},{"text":"써야겠구나.","meaning":"花，费，花费","explanation":"쓰다：花，费，花费；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"5","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써야겠구나","audio":"/audio/df7e48f9a66009b91640.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"07c35f2a6c1c1bdf","term":"용돈","zh":"零花钱，零用钱","audio":"/audio/07c35f2a6c1c1bdf46f2.mp3","entryId":"67869","definition":"个人可以用于多种用途自由支配的钱。","pronunciation":["용ː똔"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"f72efea0664035d0","term":"아끼다","zh":"节省，可惜","audio":"/audio/f72efea0664035d04563.mp3","entryId":"24445","definition":"重视某个东西，不乱使用而小心对待。","pronunciation":["아끼다"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"花，费，花费","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事用时间或钱。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8450d5c09491840877c5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.676,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24445","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2281,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来得节省一下零用钱了。","这个月我要花的钱太多了。","你和朋友见面得还顺利吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个月我要花的钱太多了。","你和朋友见面得还顺利吗？","看来得节省一下零用钱了。"],"answer":2}]}
